<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Formula 1: Visual Explorer - SmartKiddo Universe</title>
    
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@300..700&family=Nunito:ital,wght@0,200..1000;1,200..1000&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>
        :root {
            --space-bg: linear-gradient(135deg, #0b001a 0%, #1a0b36 50%, #030008 100%);
            --glass-bg: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            --glass-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            --neon-pink: #ff2a85;
            --neon-blue: #00f0ff;
            --neon-purple: #bd00ff;
            --neon-yellow: #ffdf00;
            --neon-green: #39ff14;
            --text-light: #ffffff;
            --text-muted: #b5a8cb;
            --accent-gradient: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--neon-pink), var(--neon-blue));
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
        }

        h1, h2, h3, .brand, .btn, .step-badge {
            font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background: var(--space-bg);
            color: var(--text-light);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            position: relative;
        }

        body::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background-image: 
                radial-gradient(white, rgba(255,255,255,.2) 2px, transparent 40px),
                radial-gradient(white, rgba(255,255,255,.15) 1px, transparent 30px);
            background-size: 550px 550px, 350px 350px;
            background-position: 0 0, 40px 60px;
            opacity: 0.4;
            z-index: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        header {
            background: rgba(11, 0, 26, 0.6);
            backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(15px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            padding: 15px 40px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            z-index: 10;
            position: relative;
        }

        .brand-container {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .brand {
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: 700;
            background: var(--accent-gradient);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            text-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.3);
        }

        .gamification-status {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .profile-capsule {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            padding: 6px 16px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
        }

        .avatar {
            font-size: 22px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            width: 36px; height: 36px;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            border-radius: 50%; border: 1px solid var(--neon-blue);
        }

        .xp-container {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 4px;
        }

        .xp-label {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .xp-bar-bg {
            width: 100px; height: 8px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden;
        }

        .xp-bar-fill {
            width: 0%; height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--neon-blue), var(--neon-purple));
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--neon-blue);
            transition: width 0.5s ease;
        }

        .lang-dropdown {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            color: white;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            cursor: pointer;
            outline: none;
            transition: border-color 0.3s;
        }

        .lang-dropdown:hover { border-color: var(--neon-blue); }
        .lang-dropdown option { background-color: #1a0b36; color: white; }

        main {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .glass-card {
            background: var(--glass-bg);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 32px;
            padding: 40px;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 800px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .back-classroom-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            padding-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .classroom-badge {
            background: rgba(255, 42, 133, 0.2);
            border: 1px solid var(--neon-pink);
            color: var(--neon-pink);
            padding: 5px 12px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        h2 { font-size: 30px; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #fff; text-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255,255,255,0.2); }
        .subtitle { color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 30px; font-size: 15px; }

        .teacher-box {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 15px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            padding: 15px 20px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            text-align: left;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .teacher-avatar { font-size: 36px; }
        .teacher-speech { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; color: #e2d9f3; }

        /* Step Card Styling */
        .step-container { text-align: left; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .step-header { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .step-badge {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--neon-pink), var(--neon-purple));
            color: white; width: 28px; height: 28px; display: flex;
            align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-radius: 50%;
            font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;
        }
        .step-title { font-size: 18px; color: var(--neon-blue); font-weight: bold; }

        /* Simulator Board */
        .simulator-section {
            background: rgba(11, 0, 26, 0.4);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .equation-selector-container {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .btn-eq {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            color: white; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 14px;
            font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        .btn-eq:hover, .btn-eq.active {
            border-color: var(--neon-pink);
            background: rgba(255, 42, 133, 0.15);
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 42, 133, 0.3);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .formula-summary-bar {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 15px 0;
            color: var(--neon-yellow);
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
        }

        .interactive-prompt {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--neon-blue);
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            animation: pulseText 1.5s infinite;
        }

        @keyframes pulseText {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 0.8; }
            50% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.02); }
        }

        /* Ten-Frame Grid CSS */
        .frames-wrapper {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 20px;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }

        .frame-box {
            background: rgba(11, 0, 26, 0.7);
            border: 2px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 15px;
            max-width: 320px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .frame-label {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .ten-frame-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
            grid-template-rows: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .ten-frame-cell {
            aspect-ratio: 1;
            border: 2px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
            border-radius: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            position: relative;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.01);
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        /* Cell States */
        .ten-frame-cell.filled-a {
            border: 2px solid var(--neon-pink);
            background: rgba(255, 42, 133, 0.05);
        }
        .ten-frame-cell.filled-b {
            border: 2px solid var(--neon-blue);
            background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.05);
        }

        /* Active Tap Chaser Glow */
        .ten-frame-cell.next-to-tap {
            border-color: var(--neon-yellow) !important;
            box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--neon-yellow);
            animation: pulseGlow 1s infinite alternate;
        }

        @keyframes pulseGlow {
            from { transform: scale(1); }
            to { transform: scale(1.05); }
        }

        /* Tapped / Checked Counted State */
        .ten-frame-cell.tapped {
            background: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.15) !important;
            border-color: var(--neon-green) !important;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.2);
        }

        .crystal-item {
            font-size: 26px;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 5px rgba(255,255,255,0.2));
            user-select: none;
            transition: transform 0.2s;
        }

        .cell-number {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 2px;
            right: 4px;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            opacity: 0.5;
        }

        .ten-frame-cell.tapped .cell-number {
            color: var(--neon-green);
            font-size: 12px;
            opacity: 1;
        }

        /* Science & Parent Corner Toggle */
        .corner-toggle-btn {
            background: rgba(255, 223, 0, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid var(--neon-yellow);
            color: var(--neon-yellow);
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: bold;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            margin: 10px 0 25px;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .corner-toggle-btn:hover {
            background: var(--neon-yellow);
            color: #0b001a;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 223, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .pedagogical-corner {
            background: rgba(255, 223, 0, 0.02);
            border: 1px dashed var(--neon-yellow);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 20px 25px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            text-align: left;
            display: none;
            animation: fadeIn 0.4s ease-out;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-10px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        .corner-section h4 {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--neon-yellow);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-weight: bold;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .corner-section p {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .corner-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.15);
            color: var(--neon-blue);
            padding: 3px 8px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-right: 5px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        /* Strategy Cards Panel */
        .strategy-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 650px) {
            .strategy-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }

        .strategy-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .strategy-card.normal-branch { border-color: var(--neon-blue); }
        .strategy-card.slow-branch { border-color: var(--neon-purple); }

        .strat-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .normal-branch .strat-header { color: var(--neon-blue); }
        .slow-branch .strat-header { color: var(--neon-purple); }

        .strat-tips-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .strat-item h5 {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #fff;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .strat-item p {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        /* Mini-Lab Quiz Arena */
        .quiz-arena {
            background: rgba(255, 42, 133, 0.03);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 42, 133, 0.2);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .quiz-arena-title {
            color: var(--neon-pink);
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
        }

        .quiz-equation-display {
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: white;
            margin: 15px 0;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .options-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: 12px;
            max-width: 400px;
            margin: 20px auto 0;
        }

        @media (max-width: 450px) {
            .options-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
        }

        .btn-opt {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            color: white; padding: 12px; border-radius: 14px;
            font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .btn-opt:hover {
            border-color: var(--neon-pink);
            background: rgba(255, 42, 133, 0.1);
        }

        .btn-opt.correct {
            background: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.15) !important;
            border-color: var(--neon-green) !important;
            color: var(--neon-green);
        }

        .btn-opt.incorrect {
            background: rgba(255, 42, 133, 0.15) !important;
            border-color: var(--neon-pink) !important;
            color: var(--neon-pink);
        }

        .feedback-message {
            margin-top: 15px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 14px;
            min-height: 20px;
        }

        /* Buttons & Footer */
        .btn-navigation {
            background: transparent; color: var(--text-muted);
            border: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
            padding: 12px 25px; border-radius: 15px;
            font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold;
            width: auto; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
            cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s;
        }

        .btn-navigation:hover {
            color: white; border-color: white; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
        }

        footer {
            padding: 20px; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-muted);
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03); z-index: 10;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="brand-container" onclick="App.goBack()">
            <span class="brand">SmartKiddo Universe</span>
        </div>
        
        <div class="gamification-status">
            <div class="profile-capsule">
                <div class="avatar" id="avatar-emoji">🚀</div>
                <div class="xp-container">
                    <span id="header-user" class="xp-label">Hi, Kiddo!</span>
                    <div class="xp-bar-bg">
                        <div class="xp-bar-fill" id="xp-bar-fill"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <select id="lang-select" class="lang-dropdown" onchange="App.changeLanguage(this.value)">
                <option value="en">English</option>
                <option value="my">Bahasa Melayu</option>
                <option value="zh">中文</option>
            </select>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <div class="glass-card">
            
            <div class="back-classroom-header">
                <span class="classroom-badge" id="badge-txt">Classroom 1</span>
                <button class="btn-navigation" onclick="App.goBack()" style="margin:0; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius:10px; font-size:12px;">
                    <span>⬅️</span> <span id="back-nav-txt">Exit Class</span>
                </button>
            </div>

            <h2 id="class-title">Cosmic Ten-Frame Classroom</h2>
            <p id="class-subtitle" class="subtitle">Formula 1: The Visual Explorer (Penjelajah Visual)</p>

            <!-- Guide Box -->
            <div class="teacher-box">
                <div class="teacher-avatar">🧑‍🚀</div>
                <div class="teacher-speech" id="teacher-speech-bubble">
                    Hey Cadet! Let's explore why the Ten-Frame is our magical space weapon to add numbers instantly without getting lost!
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Parent & Teacher Pedagogy Toggle -->
            <button class="corner-toggle-btn" onclick="App.togglePedagogy()">
                💡 <span id="corner-btn-txt">Show Parents & Teachers Corner</span>
            </button>
            <div class="pedagogical-corner" id="pedagogical-panel">
                <div class="corner-section">
                    <h4 id="corner-sec1-title">Pedagogical Framework: Why this works</h4>
                    <p id="corner-sec1-desc">
                        Designed for cognitive loading offloading. Traditional math forces slow learners to calculate mentally, overloading working memory. Our system externalizes memory onto structured Ten-Frames, helping kids subitize groups of 5 and 10 effortlessly.
                    </p>
                    <div style="margin-bottom: 15px;">
                        <span class="corner-badge">KSSR Year 1 Aligned</span>
                        <span class="corner-badge">Dyscalculia Support</span>
                        <span class="corner-badge">Multi-Sensory Chimes</span>
                        <span class="corner-badge">Concrete-to-Pictorial</span>
                    </div>
                    <h4 id="corner-sec2-title">Instructions for Parents/Teachers</h4>
                    <p id="corner-sec2-desc">
                        1. Select different equations below to show how addition regrouping fills up a frame of 10 first.<br>
                        2. Ask the student to count aloud by tapping the pulsing crystal. Notice the changing sound and color preventing tracking loss.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Step 1: Introduction -->
            <div class="step-container">
                <div class="step-header">
                    <div class="step-badge">1</div>
                    <div class="step-title" id="step1-title">Understand the Space Weapon</div>
                </div>
                <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size:14px; line-height:1.5;" id="step1-desc">
                    Counting scattered items can make your head spin! The Ten-Frame (Bingkai Sepuluh) locks objects into 10 perfect boxes (5 on top, 5 on bottom). When a row is full, it's always 5. When the grid is full, it's 10!
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Step 2: Interactive Simulator -->
            <div class="step-container">
                <div class="step-header">
                    <div class="step-badge">2</div>
                    <div class="step-title" id="step2-title">Interactive Crystal Visualizer</div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="simulator-section">
                    <label style="display:block; margin-bottom: 12px; font-weight:bold; font-size:13px; text-transform:uppercase; color: var(--neon-blue);" id="label-selector">
                        Select a math mission to load:
                    </label>
                    <div class="equation-selector-container">
                        <button class="btn-eq" onclick="App.selectSimulatorEq(4, 2)" id="eq-btn-1">4 + 2</button>
                        <button class="btn-eq" onclick="App.selectSimulatorEq(5, 5)" id="eq-btn-2">5 + 5</button>
                        <button class="btn-eq" onclick="App.selectSimulatorEq(7, 4)" id="eq-btn-3">7 + 4</button>
                        <button class="btn-eq" onclick="App.selectSimulatorEq(8, 5)" id="eq-btn-4">8 + 5</button>
                    </div>

                    <div class="formula-summary-bar" id="eq-display-str">
                        4 + 2 = ?
                    </div>

                    <div class="interactive-prompt" id="prompt-txt">
                        👉 Tap on each crystal to count them aloud!
                    </div>

                    <!-- Visual Frames Grid wrapper -->
                    <div class="frames-wrapper" id="frames-container">
                        <!-- Dynamically populated ten-frames -->
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Step 3: Scientific Tips and Tricks -->
            <div class="step-container">
                <div class="step-header">
                    <div class="step-badge">3</div>
                    <div class="step-title" id="step3-title">Cosmic Secrets (Tips & Tricks)</div>
                </div>

                <div class="strategy-grid">
                    <!-- Normal Learners -->
                    <div class="strategy-card normal-branch">
                        <div class="strat-header">
                            <span>🚀</span> <span id="normal-strat-title">Quick Cosmic Thinkers</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="strat-tips-list">
                            <div class="strat-item">
                                <h5 id="normal-tip1-head">The "Group of 5" Shortcut</h5>
                                <p id="normal-tip1-body">Don't count the top row! Once the top row is full, just lock "5" in your mind and count the extras: 5... 6, 7!</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="strat-item">
                                <h5 id="normal-tip2-head">Make 10 Regrouping</h5>
                                <p id="normal-tip2-body">When adding numbers like 8 + 5, look at how 8 only needs 2 more to complete 10. Take 2 away from 5, leaving 3. The answer is instantly 10 + 3 = 13!</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Slow / Dyscalculic Learners -->
                    <div class="strategy-card slow-branch">
                        <div class="strat-header">
                            <span>🧸</span> <span id="slow-strat-title">Patient Space Heroes</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="strat-tips-list">
                            <div class="strat-item">
                                <h5 id="slow-tip1-head">Touch-to-Glow Tracking</h5>
                                <p id="slow-tip1-body">Children with dyscalculia easily double-count. Let them touch the cells in our simulator sequentially. The cells glow and display counting numbers, preventing visual tracker slips.</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="strat-item">
